><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets the foreman definitely didn\u2019t put in your contract.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Passage III \u2013 The Importance of Garlic</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaaaaaaarlic!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016680/extras/49f9e7284fd4dbcf2954af5e0be9ffd2.poster.avif?t=1760741343\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016680/extras/49f9e7284fd4dbcf2954af5e0be9ffd2.webm?t=1760741343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016680/extras/49f9e7284fd4dbcf2954af5e0be9ffd2.mp4?t=1760741343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Passage IV \u2013 One Way\u2026 or Another</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the definitely safe, totally reliable path \u2013 aged gracefully over just a few centuries - to climb the crypt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or craft your very own questionable path, only a vampire could love.*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016680/extras/f05b899a5ca3f4d3534ed73d125e0af4.poster.avif?t=1760741343\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016680/extras/f05b899a5ca3f4d3534ed73d125e0af4.webm?t=1760741343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016680/extras/f05b899a5ca3f4d3534ed73d125e0af4.mp4